    "ViNT": "Same front-camera history, taught subgoal and waypoint tracker as GNM, with a better observed office-loop collision count on an independent robot. Test it at ambiguous pre-dock branches.",
    "GNM": "Smaller author artifact and smaller published parameter count with the same task and output interface. Verify the gnm.pth-to-gnm_large.pth pairing.",
    "Nav2+QR": "A known station has a mapped staging pose and an authoritative QR identity. No local comparative evidence justifies changing this baseline.",
    "OmniVLA-Edge": "First separate language experiment only when varying a goal phrase should change the action. Pinned ungated weights, extra CLIP dependency and source-level CPU portability issue."
  },
